sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Worker
    participant API as Claim API
    participant DB as Task store
    participant RE as Reaper
    participant REV as Review
    W->>API: give me work
    API->>DB: one conditional UPDATE, SKIP LOCKED
    Note over API,DB: server chooses — workers never browse, or the hard tasks rot
    DB-->>W: task + lease (owner, lease_until)
    loop while the tab is open
        W->>DB: heartbeat extends the lease
        W->>DB: autosave partial answer
    end
    alt worker abandons
        RE->>DB: lease expired → AVAILABLE, attempts++
        Note over RE,DB: no presence service, no failure detector
        W->>DB: late submit
        DB-->>W: rejected — "reassigned while you were away"
    else worker submits
        W->>DB: submit WHERE owner=me AND state=CLAIMED
        DB->>REV: if the batch policy requires review
        REV-->>DB: approve → COMPLETED, or reject with feedback
    end
    Note over DB: attempts exhausted escalates to a supervisor — the task is ambiguous, not the workers
